        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises H-195 Modern Hexagonal Door Stop</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis very modern floor mount door stop adds a touch of sophistication to any room.  It is equally suited for use in private residential or high end commercial applications.  The 2\" tall  height allows it to work with undercut doors and thick carpeted floors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis modern door stop is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. If using near a wall, you want to mount this in a position so that the bumper makes contact before the door knob touches the wall. Thus protecting not just the door, but the door knob or lever as well.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <b>Shorter <a href=\"/products/modern-1-inch-hexagonal-floor-mount-door-stop-fei-h-185\">1 Inch Modern Hexagonal Door Stop</a></b>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nOnly one hole to drill makes installation fast and easy.  Packaged with mounting hardware.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Field Enterprises H-195 Tall Modern Hexagonal Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Diameter:  1\"</li>\r\n<li>Floor to Bumper Height:  1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Ring: Black Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li> \r\n<li>Mounting Hardware:  #12 x 1-1/2\" screw</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
