                "title": "Modern 2 Inch Hexagonal Floor Mount Door Stop, FEI-H-195",
                "description": "Field Enterprises H-195 Modern 2 Inch Hexagonal Floor Mount Door Stops. This very modern floor mount door stop adds a touch of sophistication to any room.  It is equally suited for use in private residential or high end commercial applications.  Available in Polished Brass, Antique Brass, Satin Nickel, Oil Rubbed Bronze, Polished Chrome, and Polished Nickel.",
